flowchart LR
  A[New client] --> B[Onboarding workspace]
  B --> C[Upload documents]
  C --> D[AI extraction and completeness]
  D --> E[KYC and identity verification]
  E --> F[AML screening]
  F --> G{Exceptions?}
  G -- Yes --> H[Route to Compliance Agent]
  G -- No --> I[Submit for approval]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Account activated]
  J --> K[Handoff to Advisor]
